ired before content is\ndocs/design/dao.stream.serve.md:970:claimed over UDP, section 6.3, but not designed here); parallel candidate\ndocs/design/dao.stream.serve.md:976:UDP has none until a Noise-shaped channel exists, and until then UDP\ndocs/design/dao.stream.serve.md:980:## 13. UCF integration\ndocs/design/dao.stream.serve.md:1022:## 14. Completion criteria\ndocs/design/dao.stream.serve.md:1035:4. **UDP under loss, reorder and duplication**, through a lossy socket\ndocs/design/dao.stream.serve.md:1044:6. **Punch and fallback.** Two UDP peers behind a NAT simulator obtain a\ndocs/design/dao.stream.serve.md:1074:13. **Frame budget and oversize.** Over a channel with a small frame\ndocs/design/dao.stream.serve.md:1092:## 15. Decisions awaiting the owner\ndocs/design/dao.stream.serve.md:1117:  interpreter rule, not a protocol frame.\ndocs/design/dao.stream.serve.md:1128:  `dao.jing.remote.step` and unify the three copies of the ingress check\ndocs/design/dao.stream.serve.md:1131:## 16. Edits this document implies in other files\ndocs/design/dao.stream.serve.md:1157:- `docs/design/daostream-udp-design.md`: marked superseded prior art; its\ndocs/design/dao.stream.serve.md:1165:  `dao.jing.remote.step`\" and names `dao.stream.rpc` on a request and\ndocs/design/dao.stream.serve.md:1173:  extracted once and shared with `dao.jing.remote.step` and the linker.\ndocs/design/dao.stream.serve.md:1181:## 17. Prior art and lineage\ndocs/design/dao.stream.serve.md:1183:`daostream-udp-design.md` (v1) carried datoms as datagrams with a\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/ws.cljc:30:   the frame kind its payloads ride (:text or :binary), the portable-value\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/ws.cljc:36:       (contains? #{:text :binary} (:ws/frame-kind x))\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/ws.cljc:133:  ;; inspects it; the host `:send!` seam owns the typed frame.\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/ws.cljc:211:                (send-result socket ((:ws/encode codec) {:ws/frame :ws/value\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/ws.cljc:282:  \"Adapter entry for the authoritative first `:ws/disclaim` control frame.\"\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/ws.cljc:297:  \"Decode one inbound frame payload with the handle's codec and dispatch its\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/ws.cljc:304:      (let [frame ((:ws/decode codec) payload)]\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/ws.cljc:306:          (and (= :ws/accept (:ws/frame frame)) (= :connecting (:phase @state)))\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/ws.cljc:309:          (and (= :ws/disclaim (:ws/frame frame)) (= :connecting (:phase @state)))\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/ws.cljc:312:          (and (= :ws/value (:ws/frame frame))\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/ws.cljc:313:               (contains? frame :ws/value)\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/ws.cljc:315:               ((:ws/portable-value? codec) (:ws/value frame)))\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/ws.cljc:316:          (emit! state attachment :ws/payload (:ws/value frame))\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/ws.cljc:324:  \"Adapter entry for one text WebSocket message.  A text frame on a binary\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/ws.cljc:325:   profile is a protocol failure — the transport reads the frame's declared\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/ws.cljc:328:  (if (= :text (:ws/frame-kind (.-codec ^WsHandle handle)))\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/ws.cljc:337:   binary frame on a text profile is a protocol failure.\"\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/ws.cljc:339:  (if (= :binary (:ws/frame-kind (.-codec ^WsHandle handle)))\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/ws.cljc:360:   `:message!` receives text frames and `:binary!` binary frames — the two\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/ws.cljc:495:       (do (send-result socket ((:ws/encode codec) {:ws/frame :ws/disclaim}))\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/ws.cljc:497:           {:ws/status :ws/disclaimed})\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/ws.cljc:518:                 offer {:ws/attachment id :ws/event :ws/accepted\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/ws.cljc:536:                   {:ws/status :ws/offer-failed})))))))))\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/ws.cljc:543:       (= :ws/accept (:ws/command ack))\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/ws.cljc:555:    (let [sent (send-result socket ((:ws/encode codec) {:ws/frame :ws/accept}))]\n",